    "title": "<p><strong>Table&nbsp;3.07</strong> Differential diagnosis of tumours and lesions of the breast with eosinophilic granular cells</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Imported from 5th edition<br><br><p>Dilani Lokuhetty</p>",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-layout-alt: fixed; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 12.16%; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"12%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Diagnosis</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 27.36%; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"27%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Morphology</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.7%; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"1%\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 58.8%; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"58%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Immunohistochemical profile</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.8%; border: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"13%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cytoplasm</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.56%; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"13%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Nucleus</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.7%; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"1%\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.42%; border: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cytokeratin</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.42%; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">GCDFP-15</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.42%; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">ER</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.42%; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">AR</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.42%; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">S100</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.42%; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">CD68</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.34%; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Additional markers</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 12.16%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"12%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Invasive breast carcinoma with oncocytic pattern</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.8%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"13%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Abundant, brightly eosinophilic, and granular, with well-defined borders</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.56%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"13%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Round and centrally located, with prominent nucleoli</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.7%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"1%\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.42%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.42%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;/+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.42%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Mostly +</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.42%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;/+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.42%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.42%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.34%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Mitochondrial stains +</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">25% ERBB2 (HER2)+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 12.16%; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"12%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Invasive apocrine carcinoma</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.8%; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"13%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Abundant, granular, and eosinophilic or vacuolated, with distinct cell borders</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.56%; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"13%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Enlarged and round to oval, with marked/moderate atypia and prominent nucleoli</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.7%; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"1%\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.42%; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">+</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.42%; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">+</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.42%; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&minus;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.42%; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">+</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.42%; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"8%\">\r\n<p c